ide. Now you must venture inside the most dangerous place of this world: the High Peak.","source_tag":"_t","target":"你征服了兽人军团的最高领袖，现在你必须向这个世界最危险的地方挺进：巅峰。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"39df04550c6c1e8977860ca184736908036d82ada18aeacac6fa42d6239d664c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"02b1a80479854f290d52b4a9f6c74c8f4559244d5f348bfabfbc32489434c897","logical_entry_identity":"c539cd05268871cfbc229c4cf332258c3a4c57055c71a514b208201ad2bd5312","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Ideally, you thought your way through that challenge instead of just using trial-and-error.\n\nEvery five points of #LIGHT_GREEN#Physical Save#WHITE#, #LIGHT_GREEN#Spell Save#WHITE#, and #LIGHT_GREEN#Mental Save#WHITE# knocks a turn off the duration of appropriate timed effects.\n\nThis is opposed by the attacker's corresponding offensive #GOLD#combat stat#WHITE#. They undo one turn of your duration reduction for every five points of their offensive #GOLD#combat stat#WHITE#.\n\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"理想情况下，你是通过思考得出答案，而不只是反复试错。\n\n#LIGHT_GREEN#物理豁免#WHITE#、#LIGHT_GREEN#法术豁免#WHITE#和#LIGHT_GREEN#精神豁免#WHITE#每有 5 点，就会使对应持续效果的持续时间缩短 1 回合。\n\n攻击者对应的攻击性 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE#会与之对抗。攻击者每有 5 点对应的攻击性 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE#，就会抵消 1 回合由你的豁免带来的持续时间缩短。\n\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7fd13eb68571fa8c6c3c34a8cec836233d4640bb79d4337fa6126c6084285967","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"02b45449b39a12484e36f32614b7b92903828a86589f1b554a054c5ef9f93cd2","logical_entry_identity":"878dec36a963a8210aa9b22486e59f9f47d703c377ca164033967449b1259dd8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A pearl, three times the size of a normal pearl, that glitters in infinite colours, with slight patterns ever shifting away.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一颗比其他要大三倍的珍珠。它的表面不断的闪烁着光芒，似乎有奇妙的花纹在其表面一闪而逝。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9b17c3aba526109b0dbc8d652253091140c818d1f76890d7cf9a2d848327b392","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"02b6d89c3313b6a5c19474e974285ae5de2cd2f3d32336d9e5785a51301244c0","logical_entry_identity":"fdfd75b14aa43fdf9dc12d5922103832c323ae3e445ab9ff0174eff2d18dd8a5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Object will be equipped if possible, otherwise added to main inventory","source_tag":"_t","target":"物品将会尽可能被装备，否则会被加入物品栏。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1f2fd0c6c8ca3b86079dad2be62532e9e8f1542570b2bb0066d7934a32e1e409","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"02b7dfd2c9fe30d6f03debbb1363af14e306ae97527ccf4fda323633342bba04","logical_entry_identity":"9f2bb72a632d6227ce9162bed1e425b17f69a447623038438fbf4c09020fd671","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A large shimmering maul that seems to produce a ringing in your ears.  It is both as malleable as thought and as hard as the strongest steel.","source_tag":"_t","target":"一个闪闪发光的大战槌，你的耳朵里似乎能听到它发出的鸣响。它既像思想一样可塑，又像最强的钢铁一样坚硬。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a81929ba1b96e874f08c13a1d7a666a05516d3cc3184ef4c30850693d9217dd9","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"02b943cc99cb8290be98356cd81f8b98214590b38801a8adc691191d1e5d5551","logical_entry_identity":"60ed1b80416b55a3ed328db2b86b3e629a4bc79fbf9f3cf6d9e0ca898c657739","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Fortress Energy#LAST#\nThe energy of the Sher'Tul Fortress. It is replenished by transmogrifying items and used to power all the Fortress systems.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#堡垒能量#LAST#\n夏·图尔堡垒的能量。使用转化之盒可以为堡垒充能，能量可以用于驱动堡垒的各项设施。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d670fbb9d317b96eeab8bce9484b1417cfda7ee1a203bd4b4712bce957e86f2f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"02bad30c49b20f3b5562938bbb5e563c6c4fec01ecb782bc7a66c2b9f1f7b81c","logical_entry_identity":"69ef35cfd12a4aea88288b83146565bd82e244a1740dbb8bcb6ed9c8647821b7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"dogroth caldera","source_tag":"newLore category","target":"达格罗斯火山"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8bce544115b91d37ecfae41bc6876f19589a5da3b6c150555aa9642a30f5488a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity"